<<~ ahu slot=`#/tension`>>

!! Texture and Tension

# Prior-art can justify architecture and still leave breakage pathways untested.
# Adversarial posture can find faults and still drift without doctrine-level meaning.
# Capability law needs both cryptographic validity and semantic caveat validity.
# Worker/channel reliability gains can trade off with observability unless receipts stay explicit.

Bridge pattern:

```
quote-grounded prior-art -> explicit invariant law
explicit invariant law -> executable adversarial tests
executable adversarial tests -> receipt-backed trust
```

<<~/ahu>>

